<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it downgraded NationsBank Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/4 to 56-7/8.</p>
<p>-- On Monday the company said the business outlook for the remainder of this year &quot;looks very good,&quot; and trends are &quot;positive across our franchise.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Net income for the first quarter rose 38 percent to $709 million.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
